flowchart LR
  User[Challenge operator / participant] --> UI[Vite React UI]
  UI --> API[Flask API routes]

  subgraph Backend[Modular monolith backend]
    API --> Retrieval[Retrieval use cases]
    API --> Submission[Submission use cases]
    Retrieval --> Catalog[Shot catalog repository]
    Retrieval --> Scoring[Pure scoring and grouping policies]
    Retrieval --> Encoder[Embedding encoder port]
    Retrieval --> Store[Vector store port]
    Submission --> Catalog
  end

  Catalog --> LocalJSON[(Sample shots.json)]
  Encoder --> FGCLIP[FG-CLIP adapter]
  Encoder --> BEIT3[BEiT-3 adapter]
  Store --> Milvus[Milvus adapter]
  Store --> Qdrant[Qdrant adapter]

  subgraph Offline[Offline pipeline and benchmark]
    Media[Videos and keyframes] --> Artifact[Embedding artifact + manifest]
    Artifact --> Harness[Benchmark harness]
    Harness --> Store
    Harness --> Report[Benchmark report and ADR input]
  end
